    "| 6         | 1.515625 | 1.5234375 | 1.51953125 |\n",
    "\n",
    "Continuing further gives:\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "x \\approx 1.52138\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "### Error Analysis\n",
    "\n",
    "After each iteration, the interval length is cut in half.\n",
    "\n",
    "If the initial interval length is:\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "L_0=b-a\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "then after n iterations:\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\text{Error}\\leq\\frac{b-a}{2^n}\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "This gives a guaranteed upper bound on the error.\n",
    "\n",
    "As, initial interval:\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "[1,2]\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "Length:\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "L_0=1\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "After 10 iterations:\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\text{Error}\\le\\frac{1}{2^{10}}\n",
    "$$\n",
