    "If\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "f(a)f(x_r)<0\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "then set:\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "b=x_r\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "Otherwise:\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "a=x_r\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "### Step 5\n",
    "\n",
    "Repeat until the desired accuracy is obtained."
