    "# Gaussian Elimination Method\n",
    "\n",
    "The **Gaussian Elimination Method** is one of the most important techniques in **Numerical Analysis** and **Linear Algebra** for solving a system of linear equations. It transforms a system of equations into an equivalent system that is easier to solve by systematically eliminating variables.\n",
    "\n",
    "Gaussian Elimination is used to solve systems of the form:\n",
    "$$\n",
