    "## Charecterstics\n",
    "\n",
    "### Advantages\n",
    "\n",
    "1. Simple: Easy to understand and implement.\n",
    "2. Systematic: Works for many systems of linear equations.\n",
    "3. Foundation for Advanced Methods  \n",
    "    Used as the basis for:\n",
